cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its ideas, please cite the paper below and, where relevant, the software release."
title: "ensemble-codesim: An Ensemble of Unsupervised Similarity Measures for Source Code Clone Detection (with the CodeSim toolkit)"
abstract: >-
  An open toolkit and study for source code clone detection that combines more
  than twenty unsupervised similarity measures into a single, inspectable
  ensemble. Includes the CodeSim Python package (a unified interface, ensembles,
  evaluation metrics, and dataset loaders) and a reproducible evaluation on
  BigCloneBench.
